[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Escape]
[00:12.59]Why did the prisoner attack the driver?
[00:18.38]When he had killed the guard,
[00:21.03]the prisoner of war quickly dragged him into the bushes.
[00:26.31]Working rapidly in the darkness, he soon changed into the dead man's clothes.
[00:33.78]Now, dressed in a blue uniform and with a rifle over his shoulder,
[00:39.26]the prisoner marched boldly up and down in front of the camp.
[00:45.28]He could hear shouting in the camp itself.
[00:48.53]Lights were blazing and men were running here and there:
[00:53.29]they had just discovered that a prisoner had escaped.
[00:58.03]At that moment, a large black car with four officers inside it, stopped at the camp gates.
[01:08.18]The officers got out and the prisoner stood to attention and saluted as they passed.
[01:16.06]When they had gone the driver of the car came towards him.
[01:22.02]The man obviously wanted to talk.
[01:25.96]He was rather elderly with grey hair and clear blue eyes.
[01:32.13]The prisoner felt sorry for him, but there was nothing else he could do.
[01:38.47]As the man came near the prisoner knocked him to the ground with a sharp blow.
[01:44.60]Then, jumping into the car, he drove off as quickly as he could.
